  teacherName: Imatomi
  dialoguePopUp: {fileID: 1256853252}
  dialogueManager: {fileID: 1682790333}
  spellSelectionScreen: {fileID: 0}
  battleScreen: {fileID: 0}
  element: 
  totalNumOfElementSpells: 0
  initalLines:
  - Welcome in, sweetie!
  - One of the best ways to learn fire magic is to see how other creatures utilize
    it.
  - "Observe Biscuit\u2014she breathes fire!"
  afterPuzzleLines:
  - Yes, wonderful.
  - "Record this in your notes, but don\u2019t take too long."
  - "It\u2019s time to take your findings and do a secondary exploration."
  afterBattleLines:
  - "I\u2019m confident you have the skills to properly handle this spell now."
  afterSpellLines:
  - Be sure to stay curious!
